        <td colspan="3" style="border: 1px dashed #333; padding: 8px;">
            <p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Specific Objective:</b> Mediation: Text: Mediate school announcements for new students. Communication: Facilitate a discussion on a group project.</p>
            <p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Learning Outcome:</b> Mediation: Can mediate school announcements on healthy practices for peers by using simple words and two languages if needed (e.g., explains "balanced" in both English and familiar language).
Can facilitate a discussion on healthy eating by guiding turn-taking and encouraging classmates to share (e.g., encourages each student to share a favorite healthy food).
Can help peers understand balanced diets by using simple words and two languages if needed (e.g., explains "balanced" using examples like eating both meat and vegetables during lunch or adding fruit for dessert.").</p>
        </td>
    </tr>
